{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 951,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81eb2f3972f11a6d00f8982e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘处于最终弯道且身处后方向前逼近时\\n短时间内加速度少量提升,每次超越其他马娘\\n都会增强效果并刷新时间,最多增强三次",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5eab17e3a02b0075ad3e15f1e22ca4ff43ee25e58e0f1e8e4726592611e6fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08fa85a5a1af20ed9d41a2fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段若从后方进行了超越\\n剩余150m后自身位于前方时\\n在短时间内速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0693054198602f86d4072c37a7a8eb29f8fc7a774a1cba3f074b19320482aba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900541"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb9093deeddb2463f9838d7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中场附近位于队伍中间且附近\\n有其他赛马娘时,速度稍微提升\\n如果视野内有4人以上的赛马娘则效果增强",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d062090fa6d2c6c2e506915028964caffcd959314accef316350eb8c6c15e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0d43d53f842d2e54ae0a6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘前方受阻时\\n能够借助预言之力略微开辟道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "392068c41e40171936a1544e74fc8e16928bdb49a72f54ff19c615cf0e42c92d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:503fd88b44cb1273c422cda5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛即将进入终盘时的某刻位于后方时\\n速度持续微幅上升。若是在中长距离比赛中\\n距离领先位置越远则效果越强",
      "source_fingerprint": "153a3b32d7d3d9e29c7550c335c62e3d3ad7432ef4710b248cba77f44231ad73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76cbbdd8f209800cb0b3d48c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘完成超越时\\n会稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25db8ee9b60042151d3b8cc7658a57907cda5d3c33bf3375b593cca546faa79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f51b4a59e2ca703c1efa76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持冷静进入中盘并准备发力时\\n或是在终盘胜负关键的弯道\\n位于中部梯队时,加速能力会略微提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "313df5a489db779ff3aa91a3d44fbdcb3aab82f3dec7fb352c66ab60337e4d03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba38fc336f5a677479267843",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘处于第三名快要输掉的时候\\n激发潜藏的昂扬斗志,速略微度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba40b6b690b98c482f8cbb0cee5c9d5a416b9f71f7ba0a03d33554dba57153e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c1b07b7390b721c1d21fe1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够冷静地进行比赛的规划时\\n就能够在最后200米发挥实力,少量加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3c55d0db3d00aced8139cf8733f8efc0f30d606c08e27595503c9728ee70d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41e6e29e296109b4dc7775e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程中段前后若处在中间梯队\\n重新恢复精神使持久力略微恢复\\n并且略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "50633153ac23ee555ec3bc1b8911c64b82b67aec6838885f0d4b24292d601a72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e3d43dab64ef2f34b1bb018",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ff123498eb8c2152e0c56ce97084749d7c5eabc4221c23be08970dc87d9b59",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e2d31c1bc182b8b56ced6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从起跑到比赛后半程一直保持在前列的话\\n将略微回复持久力\\n且速度一点点上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b30464d502179f34de591d0a7e7f8e83c2eaf19c978d0f73fc8a16d13f97bae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293724745482f9adf5492ed6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘的某处位于前方时\\n速度略微提升,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则速度略微持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d853fd76e34cc8763d06d92e8424de7fe9a00487011d67bc3c7339005cd2d7c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c6096bf9603a26cc073ea7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘中段处于领头位置时\\n超长时间内速度持续略微上升\\n但终盘末段时会微幅减速",
      "source_fingerprint": "45fa37c7788f39071c7edd1c2663062fabbfb383f55bb7bc193fe511c92e5ae9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc008b3d017294338f973b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入最终直线且身处好位置时\\n稍微提升速度\\n若是接近领先赛马娘的话,提升更多速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "168f76616019dbd08cda26cffac68cd50484975d64b65f3789e1da6f8c937da8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3a7e336b751a31788f30be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "位于先头集团时,在比赛后半的第三弯道处\\n会略微加快速度。或者,在终盘身处看台对面时\\n会更有力地向前迈进",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbaae89405f46cda8c66ab7c0bc65ea34a2c0777783f8d78a85339986bcb4526",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017ef028ffc685f292d78aa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余300m处于好位置\\n且与前方赛马娘距离近时\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "817510a61bfb21ec05ca7f37680e9b78ccbd0a28e2acd13075930f6789e083fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c3c9d9fe8dbcc8b0ac18c60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余800m处位于队伍中间时\\n极少量提升加速度,若在2400m的比赛中\\n取得高人气则少量提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "914b0c16ead9bc063c09a87d02ec409412f6eef5b94c056cc9736b043338a2b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62220e9135b452f031f0b7e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上和后面的赛马娘距离较近时\\n会瞬间消耗微量的持久力\\n短时间内稍微速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc51a9ef6ea985ffeb37cd08fb7d7447df9eeeeb6333a588135754c779c5a5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900711"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:764b19c0ef04d2f8c5fe4570",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后完成超车\\n且在最后300米位于前方集团时\\n会燃起烈焰般的斗争心,略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1916561250f8fc17236fa534f985ce6fb1f9e57a4a926a11eefd4970ab9bdfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25ea5d9851a1115810e407f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘进行超越时\\n在最终直线上速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c68245059c8bfe63a5188cf719e8cfb63dc9df075d789b002fde56cc094a4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4db625fb6754763815be6ebd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半段身处中团时\\n会根据剩余体力进行相应的长距离冲刺\\n速度逐渐极小幅度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e84ea9a30d9f069f7ab96abe40b0f2093b52410dfbd49362d16f2c8e4fc5bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d2854b972c108375e8e71e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果在比赛半程处于中间梯队,速度会略微提升\\n若是长距离比赛,速度提升的持续时间将延长\\n并恢复少量体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "98f2ca095b4d1657ad2838c7573ed3a76f366c0a93cda2762d243d014098c434",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e061394280476adcf1a000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘若位于好位置,则在剩余400m的地方\\n少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "19cca141cab67e468ae9143ff05d9454093a1a05681812e81fba0b27c0303223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f9d08bb9ed02735efa60882",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程前半段压低节奏,最终弯道后半段\\n若位于前方则可长时间持续极少量提高加速度\\n若处于第2名则效果增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d0833c3bf4a954825ec4866f360120d87cb3f90d689c49f84a4f6c2392dc03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900781"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f66dc17719672371c75512",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在前方竞争时\\n则比赛后半段短时间内速度稍微提升\\n若是大井、川崎或者船桥赛场\\n则变为速度持续稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1e408f492e07a46c5dd4bb994d3fee20f7773949c852b8812c911df08b1e6c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900791"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2796a7be7cf22cc9592627c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段一直保持前方位置时\\n若后半段检测到对手发动了加速技能\\n则向前极小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "582965c0d92f8cb9f6ee41b67c92257a5cff6d8173e5e627ccde9006073cf1ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f46a85428814eca6e7affa6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中，短时间内\\n会少量向前冲出＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a379f7c06ed419e55afe6d0fb7216c9c5e65b24ce51fd36d05d3632ceb44173",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900811"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430cbccadf00a6b8062fb9e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于好位置时\\n短时间内速度稍微提升,若是英里比赛\\n则效果时间增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "af85e1898bee6248c9376c7cdf8591352e78ac340ac1b3b7c45e28982e0369c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900821"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6693f28c9e836a86c651b5ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近往后的直线处\\n位于队伍中间时,稍微提升速度,若此时为\\n下坡则稍微持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a18c6362cb397b974f58e5f32e8fc12b886d0c5c228092197aa51da925438ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900831"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd0b324bfbfed214404c7ffa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时,在最终直线处\\n稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29ae9b690cedf425e5f33a89882aebf727c5cd31269ab3f4ccebad6b4f0c12c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900841"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829124695f50ecb2530b7f44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷静地进行比赛,突入终盘时位于后方附近时\\n稍微向前突进,并略微威慑从领头开始\\n至多4名赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09901fff9dac45f9fd6c8cec750f3cfc4ee2ab224a79793e62ec24da7e3d656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a60b84b208cded7a609b42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m时若位于前方\\n则稍微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b90efc70a69afe2a6e776ca8d5633d57f9996b987c59abf4b06d7b3005ddf4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900861"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12dd5bd4a4a813a8b8e59315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余400米\\n位于前方并被后方马娘紧追时\\n略微容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c383d412b4a66b0f43119d87fa586e7b87d4626bacadcb7cb93b06ebaba1af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900871"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca63c49f8e88ce7f83aa97f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于队伍中间时\\n比赛剩余400m后速度稍微提升\\n若是中距离赛在中盘有过赶超\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe638dc15ce4915247fbf7cd4e21614f5314d60af23973cde809b62b0ec8013",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900881"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553a6a79f9d163a3e81a11ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右若位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升,并回复极少量体力\\n如果比赛距离在2400m及以上\\n回复量增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "53ec715ad3805624938c975a576c1ba9e9272d302f791607e081464ea3b74ec0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900891"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d8f76053410ed9581a04cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段的弯道位于前方时,短时间内\\n速度稍微提升,若是英里或中距离比赛\\n则在之后终盘的最终直线被后方逼近时\\n较短时间内极小幅向前突进＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "639fc3738e286d864f5fd6af8297b2698e75bc6546745e8f7f38849bf576734a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900901"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:395ab05c1db3fc659486e147",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘最终直线时若位于队伍中间\\n则剩余300m之后速度略微提升\\n如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfbe5c93f15370d58d67b9fcd56525279ed18605ae1cfb87a87720f66302503",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b0c459c3377f51012980ca3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近处于优势位置时\\n速度会小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "30329228a8a089d6a16b8aef0e497af22b61c25527e75fd59bb08f8251f4529e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900921"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:439b412ae2a28cf4898a541d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘初段的某处位于前方时\\n略微向前突进,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "1baf9615539b1dfeee0d04677767df766b2c7b181a2477aa28cc3097cad13fd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:276182deee1e70ef3e69dbc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛进行一半时位置处于中间梯队\\n则速度稍微提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e089e34d1350404abb6a51625d5c457a6b8a94123befa2d9d7bfd234aff7f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c1c13371a7a6410a820957",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入终盘时若位于前方\\n会极小幅向前冲出，在短距离比赛中\\n则会持续极小幅向前冲出\\n直到抵达终点＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5b2e89914d98406aa037fc230c0acace3496848de2299c29ba9e821570433c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900951"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b811bc662947c1b03940ba8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的第3弯道位于队伍中间\\n则短时间内速度稍微提升\\n之后在终盘的最终直线准备超越时\\n速度极小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d83e26bb6921eaf9c50dd1bf8db71d537d75fbfd38a7fa9e68b20f8f62759da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900961"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ae53bf64029dbd4155132ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置处在中游位置时\\n速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42cdc8f6f02c0722a290f9188a98981cd489fd5a360309b199b9d1a7426ae95",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900971"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f25f11164471554829c0f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘的某处\\n微量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12ca5bca2d0a8b081434481f5fedc0aeae6d28ab432226f2bf5314ca1a8012d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900981"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24d79a6633c540dfe477f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沙土比赛时在中盘的弯道上竞争过后\\n在最后冲刺时处于好位置\\n加速度会微量上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c20562bb6d876c97c0922914ce9269e2c20d0a762a8fd5e0396e8db7d63920b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900991"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b676420027f407368623d8a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m时位于前方,则速度微量提升\\n若在沙土比赛中与领头赛马娘距离较近时\\n再略微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "42662462baf660bb509c11d0ff9f469207acb1d7a8a77e5d8ec357e16ffed574",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e8bcd61e3bd25806046cc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段在队伍中间且前方或后方\\n长时间有赛马娘紧贴,则回复极少量体力\\n之后在比赛中段附近的直线处\\n短时间内速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69cde92d15b4a56474e83f2f78275c3f6dce3901c3cd9913dc1d5c5bf7a6004",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5066e1e3b444bb879eb8a68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方竞争时\n持续一段时间略微提升速度\n此外若正在进行比拼，之后\n持续一段时间极微小向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ebe9558ab75a334534f3cf92f1d8806ac6fe51ae4873689661228601a9b916",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dbb570d77c0d6455b7f861f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第三弯道位于领头时,速度微量提升\\n并回复微量体力,若是东京竞马场\\n中距离比赛则增加技能持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d3d3ba0a692dc0c32bd76b6249cc428f2189bbac341e3437e429d68fdf2ea4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40fa6ffe92ebfe3c73768457",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右处在中间集团\\n速度稍微提升,若是中距离比赛,且至此为止\\n发动过7次技能,则速度会稍稍提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67c681835c4dfe3c5f23b1569c6019790708136fd28b5ef004a2ea2b0a99432",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3050e016da05a6f6c0e9ae0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半部分位于队伍中间时\\n速度持续微量提升,且在长距离比赛\\n低人气的情况下,速度持续少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c296fca3a5018155026bf6c6dd12ad5df411d9a6781a4ce3097023a7ee818423",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0240d89bbafb51a7a1a5eca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于领头时\\n速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c2fafe1a64ef7008a340fba28195d64ba98cf329c44723c4c5f594afd3d4bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd889238b4b3b4992610258a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段位于后方时速度稍微提升\\n之后在终盘的最终弯道处\\n准备超越时\\n短时间内极小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "54e53787eb005a571a3c0e97d583a22cd6546c01e664ce2b78395c69aceafc65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14999d089eca5bc76e249655",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道若位于队伍中间\\n则略微提升速度,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则变为略微持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "aea879c2609869699c14af09cdca8beeacf6914dda7379f1ef51706f4a295a52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1675a8df4ccebef393436a1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余800m自身位于队伍中间\\n则短时间内极小幅向前突进并提升极微加速度\\n若是根干距离的比赛且自身位于后方\\n则额外提供极少加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "986da772d70807aed67f11a2382d6e8abe1fc1f82e2df8467f9705614eb297d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42ab85a2f87e75111df5046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近位于队伍中间时\\n微量持续性提升速度,若当前位于上坡则提高效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade072b97753874656a289550f27a5c3b77758040550b6ebcc1e436fa09f95ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5254d03cb3d48e19ec413a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当进入比赛最终冲刺阶段时\\n速度在短时间内微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "104f834902f557642dbafe84dfe988b9e52204eff795b1676d83df04a3c5ac83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0598c2b09b667d11ab81d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段的弯道若位于好位置\\n则速度稍微提升,若是2200m的比赛则速度持续稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "261bc5c3ffd2df34c770536de220a94c4f56fc6698dbe85adc34c46755397bc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ae65b7fbe81deed672f91b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间点位于队伍中部或更后方时\n少许向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a6620cd61424ad86137ab9ee1124d63494390aca126b667bc014ec7fe948e25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430e5e24d716ccbb7425d54a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m的位置向前持续极小幅突进＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0863f964c33815c39163fcf91228aab00c5985ddd4cc00176e2ff1247f67a7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc283deb1659c9f7491bb55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道位于前方时\\n速度微量提升,之后在终盘的最终直线\\n位于队伍前方,则短时间内速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37f23341909446c19af9998a627a4ad1344b6d7feb097b42b22486de0ececa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13e1a6f39138f4d1108c45b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘以及往后完成超越\\n进入终盘的最终直线时短时间内速度稍微提升\\n若作战为追赶且比赛中盘以及往后完成3次及以上超越\\n则变为短时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa80a7dfeba2c1dbe7ff3d97dd26ef40a81f30f29731ebe45789cd67de012748",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ccba9494a90cca3649d6d7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近速度稍稍提升\\n在草地中距离比赛中\\n若技能发动时处于队伍中列或之后\\n则较长时间持续微弱提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d55cebf5195495b182fbe516cb7df4506afc10775ea95b334fd84c588f643c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe4b776825ed467b90c71bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘时位于后方且距离终点尚远\\n则短时间内向前极小幅突进\\n如果是中山竞马场或阪神竞马场的中长距离比赛\\n则之后在直线上短时间内向前小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b80a340c4ed4b38eefed7440d871fda0487d6ff1981942419948727761033011",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd808ecf73e5a047a696b141",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第4浪时若位于前方则短时间\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1597abb42f590f0ef8a992b6669f8a0557334bdc94879f0cb68590a92aefff83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaf239bb71a76a46eb705a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道完成赶超后\\n在最终冲刺时速度稍微提升\\n若在短距离和英里比赛发动技能时\\n自身位于队伍中间,则变为速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a505e0988e0cf2084cd3b9fbf22501d8e54aa297bf8a600c7cdb64ffa26519f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51568504adf777ca2df9a236",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处若位于前方\\n则略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6bbdc62f5722c11c65dc17d39ac6fd48cbba55595baa045f1efb0263169f9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02bbdb70f9835bdc45cd2409",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段的直线处位于中间位置时\\n速度稍微提升\\n若是长距离比赛则提升效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "552c8a62298742ecd97073236b0a3a5933ec32a418622a0d40b40ac9484c58cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128186de9c47e116a078ea68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道位于前方时\n短时间内少量向前突进＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a62934a5af8cde2ea6b9a918d65aa20d58043cf5820fca97b41ca2c6e4f7cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39fcc35f1ca13da05bf00320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余1000m处若身处前方\\n速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c188e4996c16d1ac0d07701ca307f5f08423e11056a1dde348554fa6ea4793ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba51e8d832df94651eec5033",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间位于中后方时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进,若是短距离英里比赛\\n则之后最终冲刺时短时间内小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "7996a8cb760fd37fbd19d8f1d0453b208400a19145a747f7f2b09bfd799e6add",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdb9d5d7e0e8e298564b309",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处速度极小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb028d70dbb44b6ed7fafcb33935131c0380db172af30fcec3481b9c95178cfb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acef03571d396fb266f61a1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近短时间内速度微量提升＜先行・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6af0f3a70b111ee4360d85749834ee4d2551980ca8f48c4235beb4edbf7d36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c9199a4e7b063f97d033eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n若附近有2名以上的赛马娘\\n则持续稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f669ea20327e10cd73c03b7784daffa1a78023aa417a752c5af7de81e33bfbec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f14a01d8da71c489b75a48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段持续少许提升速度\n若是2000m以上的比赛，\n之后会在最后冲刺阶段短暂少许提升加速度<居中/后追>",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01d2fe88835e23e56ccfc4487e705bf297a4dae1a22336c639903a5ff0359af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f6513df26d3a269fb94235",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘位于中团及以后且余力充足时\\n稍微向前突进＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f2561e206e9e3bce91ebeefece98f7a85604ce8d0d90f42f33c60e828c3c0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2094a7f81107f8cf0ab9dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘初期位于中团及以前时长时间\n持续略微向前突进<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c098352ce9265096443d8300e6064f9e3402f3b2da8802fd9c1b95d8251b65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b90d90320c4b0ee81ce2b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段一段时间内稍微提升速度\\n若是2000m以上的比赛,则在此之后\\n于最后冲刺阶段短暂地\\n稍微提升加速度＜领放/先行＞",
